", "parse_rule": "leading_letter", "is_correct": false, "http": 200, "turn_status": "answered", "basis": "general_reasoning", "trace_id": "anon-b013a741b6dec497", "response_time_ms": 5221, "answer_text": "C\n\nRunning at 30 Hz cuts the shaft speed to about half of the 60 Hz speed. Fan power varies roughly with the cube of speed, so power ≈(½)³ ≈ 0.125 of full‑speed power – about one‑eighth (12.5%)."}
